# Grace resize smoke: the plot canvas must survive a top-level resize and
# redraw its axes and curve at the new size, exercising the Motif form/drawing
# area geometry management plus the libx11-compat ConfigureNotify and backing
# texture resize path. Fails if the canvas goes blank after the resize.
delay 1500
wait-window "Grace" 15000
# Fixed settle delay rather than wait-converge: Grace's plot canvas repaints
# continuously under a live X display (Xvfb) and never quiets. See grace-startup.
delay 3000
screenshot initial
resize 900 640
delay 2000
screenshot resized
assert-image resized common-visible.json
assert-image resized grace-canvas-content.json
assert-exit running
